<title>GREECE: Greek Aug building materials price index up 6.9pct.</title>
<headline>Greek Aug building materials price index up 6.9pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's building materials price index for new housing rose 6.9 percent year-on-year in August, matching the rise in August 1995, the National Statistics Service (NSS) said.</p>
<p>The index was up 7.2 percent year-on-year in June and 7.5 percent in May.</p>
<p>						Aug 96  June 96   Aug 95</p>
<p>    Month on month change (%)	 0.1%    0.1%	0.1%</p>
<p>    Year on year change (%)	   6.9%    7.2%	6.9%</p>
<p>    Index (1990=100)		  184.9   184.6     172.9</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
